## Executive Summary
The forecast shows **diverging trajectories**: Net Sales declining sharply, while Gross Profit and Net Profit rise. However, all three metrics display **weak underlying signals** due to volatile recent months. Critically, **Net Sales projects negative values from Month+10 onwards** — a severe structural warning.

